+
 <section class="founder-r2-story" data-founder-r1="S04" id="founder-s04"><p aria-hidden="true" class="founder-r2-section-number">04</p><h2 data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S04.title.0">PHI OS does not need other tools to fail in order to matter.</h2><p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S04.lead.0">Search, artificial intelligence, social platforms, professional services, and different reading systems already solve important problems.</p>
 <p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S04.lead.1">The deeper issue is that they were not designed to jointly maintain one person’s changing reality.</p><div class="founder-r1-prose"><p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S04.body.0">Search tools such as Google are highly effective at helping people find information, websites, news, services, and different sources.</p>
 <p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S04.body.1">General AI systems such as ChatGPT and Meta AI can explain complex material, synthesize information, generate text, support research, and allow a person to continue exploring through conversation.</p>
@@ -141,41 +178,7 @@
 <p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S06.body.23">PHI OS therefore does not aim merely to become better at answering questions.</p>
 <p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S06.body.24">Its longer-term purpose is to provide an infrastructure through which a person can repeatedly:</p>
 <p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S06.body.25">see the reality they are currently facing, understand which information genuinely matters, compare possible directions while uncertainty remains, make a decision that remains their own, and return later to see what actually changed.</p></div><figure class="founder-r1-figure" data-founder-asset-id="PLAN-REALITY-05"><a data-i18n-aria-label="hpc2Destinations.founder.humanPresenceR2.figure" href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/figures/Entrance/PHIOS-FIGURE-NAVIGATION-FORMATION-1B-v1.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View full figure"><img src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/figures/Entrance/PHIOS-FIGURE-NAVIGATION-FORMATION-1B-v1.webp" width="1586" height="992" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Conceptual illustration: navigation formation 1b" data-i18n-alt="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.figures.NAVIGATION-FORMATION-1B.alt"></a><figcaption><p class="founder-r1-formation" data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.navigationFormation">Structure → Connectivity → Network → Structural Reinforcement → Direction → Position → Navigation Potential</p><a href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/figures/Entrance/PHIOS-FIGURE-NAVIGATION-FORMATION-1B-v1.webp" class="founder-r1-link" data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.navigation.full">View full figure</a></figcaption></figure><figure class="founder-r1-figure" data-founder-asset-id="PLAN-REALITY-09"><a data-i18n-aria-label="hpc2Destinations.founder.humanPresenceR2.figure" href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/figures/Entrance/PHIOS-FIGURE-OBSERVATION-RETURN-LOOP-v1.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View full figure"><img src="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/figures/Entrance/PHIOS-FIGURE-OBSERVATION-RETURN-LOOP-v1.webp" width="1586" height="992" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Conceptual illustration: observation return loop" data-i18n-alt="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.figures.OBSERVATION-RETURN-LOOP.alt"></a><figcaption><a href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/figures/Entrance/PHIOS-FIGURE-OBSERVATION-RETURN-LOOP-v1.webp" class="founder-r1-link" data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.navigation.full">View full figure</a></figcaption></figure></section>
-<section class="founder-r2-story" data-founder-r1="S07" id="founder-s07"><p aria-hidden="true" class="founder-r2-section-number">07</p><h2 data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.title.0">The more a system can connect, the more clearly it must show what each source can—and cannot—support.</h2><div class="founder-r1-prose"><p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.0">PHI OS can connect information from different domains, but connection must not erase the differences between them.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.1">This is one of the most important constraints in the system.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.2">A fact may come from an observed event or record.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.3">A financial number may come from account information or a calculation.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.4">A Profile result may come from a defined assessment or questionnaire.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.5">A professional judgment may come from a person who accepts responsibility within a specific scope.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.6">BaZi, Zi Wei, Astrology, I Ching, Tarot, and other methods provide a different kind of interpretive structure.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.7">AI can help organize, compare, explain, and connect these materials.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.8">But they do not become the same kind of evidence simply because they appear in one interface.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.9">PHI OS therefore needs to keep several questions visible:</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.10">Who provided this?</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.11">What method produced it?</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.12">What does it apply to?</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.13">Is it presenting a fact or an interpretation?</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.14">Was it reviewed by a person?</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.15">Is it still current?</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.16">Did the user choose to bring it into this question?</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.17">And what is the system actually authorized to do with it?</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.18">These boundaries become more important as AI becomes more capable.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.19">A fluent answer can combine established facts, inference, interpretation, general knowledge, model synthesis, and unresolved uncertainty in a single paragraph.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.20">If the interface no longer distinguishes those layers, the user may experience one highly confident voice where several different kinds of claims actually exist.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.21">PHI OS should not work that way.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.22">AI can participate in reading reality.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.23">But AI should not automatically become the highest authority over reality.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.24">The ability to summarize financial information does not make it a financial adviser.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.25">The ability to interpret a symbolic method does not turn that interpretation into an established personality fact.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.26">And the ability to see several sources at once does not authorize a system to make a decision for the person when consent, evidence, or responsibility is insufficient.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.27">Professional participation also needs clear boundaries.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.28">Professional responsibility belongs to a specific person, service scope, and point in time—not to a generic “Professional” label.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.29">PHI OS is designed to preserve those relationships of responsibility rather than absorb them into a vague system authority.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.30">The platform can organize and present.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.31">A professional can judge within an appropriate scope.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.32">A method can offer a perspective.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.33">AI can assist interpretation.</p>
-<p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S07.body.34">But the person retains the decision.</p></div></section><section class="founder-r2-story" data-founder-r1="S09" id="founder-s09"><p aria-hidden="true" class="founder-r2-section-number">09</p><h2 data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S09.title.0">Begin with the question you are actually facing.</h2><div class="founder-r1-prose"><p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S09.body.0">Reality Navigation does not require a person to understand the entire system before they begin.</p>
+<section class="founder-r2-story" data-founder-r1="S09" id="founder-s09"><p aria-hidden="true" class="founder-r2-section-number">09</p><h2 data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S09.title.0">Begin with the question you are actually facing.</h2><div class="founder-r1-prose"><p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S09.body.0">Reality Navigation does not require a person to understand the entire system before they begin.</p>
 <p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S09.body.1">You do not need to purchase a report, complete every personal-data field, or choose a method first.</p>
 <p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S09.body.2">Different people can enter from different points.</p>
 <p data-i18n="hpc2Destinations.founder.publication.S09.body.3">If you simply have a question, begin with Ask PHI OS.</p>
